        "TileImage": "$($repository 45341c93-bdb1-49e3-bad8-a5b2c49003db).Image",
        "Description": "Wes Liston: The Eccentric Producer. The man will stop at nothing to achieve the perfect sound. This obsession turned deadly at a recent recording session, when Liston had a heated argument with a facility janitor and proceeded to beat him brutally with a mic stand. The man died of complications shortly after. Liston&apos;s connections to the Cross family allowed him to frame the killing as a car accident. See to it that he, too, meets his untimely demise.",
